# Microchip PIC16F570 Configuration Word Definitions

# File Syntax:
# Each configuration register is given as:
# 
#     CWORD:<address>:<mask>:<default value>[:<name>[,<alias list>]]
# 
# for each CWORD the configuration settings are listed as
# 
#     CSETTING:<mask>:<name>[,<alias list>]:<description>
# 
# lastly for each CSETTING all possible values are listed as
# 
#     CVALUE:<value>:<name>[,<alias list>]:<description>
# 
# All numerical values are given in unqualified hex.  In terms of
# #pragma config, note the following correspondence:
# 
#    #pragma config CSETTING<name> = CVALUE<name>
# 
# The compiler may also emit a message when it detects certain programming.
# This behaviour is defined by the following record
# 
#     CMSG:<CSETTING name>=<CVALUE name>[,...]:<message number>
# 
# If the compiler encounters the given programming then it will emit the
# with the corresponding numnber.  Note that these records must appear last
# in the file.
# 
# Comments are also permitted.  Any line beginning with a '#'
# character will be treated as a comment.

CWORD:FFF:3DF:3FF:CONFIG
CSETTING:7:FOSC:Oscillator
CVALUE:0:LP:LP oscillator and 18 ms DRT
CVALUE:1:XT:XT oscillator and 18 ms DRT
CVALUE:2:HS:HS oscillator and 18 ms DRT
CVALUE:3:EC:EC oscillator with I/O function on OSC2/CLKOUT
CVALUE:4:INTRC_IO:INTRC with I/O function on OSC2/CLKOUT
CVALUE:5:INTRC_CLKOUT:INTRC with CLKOUT function on OSC2/CLKOUT
CVALUE:6:EXTRC_IO:EXTRC with I/O function on OSC2/CLKOUT
CVALUE:7:EXTRC_CLKOUT:EXTRC with CLKOUT function on OSC2/CLKOUT
CSETTING:8:WDTE:Watchdog Timer Enable bit
CVALUE:8:ON:Enabled
CVALUE:0:OFF:Disabled
CSETTING:10:CP:Code Protection bit
CVALUE:10:OFF:Code protection off
CVALUE:0:ON:Code protection on
CSETTING:40:IOSCFS:Internal Oscillator Frequency Select
CVALUE:40:8MHz:8 MHz INTOSC Speed
CVALUE:0:4MHz:4 MHz INTOSC Speed
CSETTING:80:CPSW:Code Protection bit - Flash Data Memory
CVALUE:80:OFF:Code protection off
CVALUE:0:ON:Code protection on
CSETTING:100:BOREN:
CVALUE:100:ON:BOR Enabled
CVALUE:0:OFF:BOR Disabled
CSETTING:200:DRTEN:
CVALUE:200:ON:DRT Enabled
CVALUE:0:OFF:DRT Disabled
CWORD:840:FFF:FFF:IDLOC0
CWORD:841:FFF:FFF:IDLOC1
CWORD:842:FFF:FFF:IDLOC2
CWORD:843:FFF:FFF:IDLOC3
